  "dataflow_findings": [
    "All seven differences belong to the direct gain pass; the nested row convolution already matches exactly.",
    "Native ESP+0x18 holds 2*input+6. EDI holds the PCM buffer. The first LEA subtracts 6 to form the tap-0 pointer, also used by tap 1 and later the row loop. Subsequent direct taps 2 through 7 use displacements -2, 0, 2, 4, 6, 8 relative to that same biased input offset.",
    "Every target differing SIB uses the input offset as base and EDI as scale-one index. The candidate exchanges these slots. This is diagnostic equivalence, never byte-exact acceptance."
  ],
